{"4039200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Exterminauts", "steam_appid": 4039200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3-PLAYER BLUE-COLLAR CREW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/extras/0d01cf2587a67f0d9f94e094790c946e.poster.avif?t=1787824372\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/extras/0d01cf2587a67f0d9f94e094790c946e.webm?t=1787824372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/extras/0d01cf2587a67f0d9f94e094790c946e.mp4?t=1787824372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the righteous battle cries of heroes. Here, combat is stripped down to a professional routine. Form a tight-knit trio of gritty, down-to-earth Exterminauts dealing with corporate honey traps and blood-soaked pest control. <u><strong>Every work order costs company money</strong></u>, so cover your crewmates, tally up your expenses, and survive your shift together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WEAPONIZED POWER TOOLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/extras/35e1e1b049c88d24e7006991f84761c9.poster.avif?t=1787824372\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/extras/35e1e1b049c88d24e7006991f84761c9.webm?t=1787824372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/extras/35e1e1b049c88d24e7006991f84761c9.mp4?t=1787824372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Industrial-grade gunplay where your everyday tools are your firearms. Unleash a flood of firepower with heavy-duty utility and repair equipment repurposed for slaughter. Activate the multi-purpose OVERDRIVE system to turn typical blue-collar gear into devastating, alien-shredding weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A HOSTILE ALIEN ECOSYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/extras/924a591fb536e509104b94e971a5ebdb.poster.avif?t=1787824372\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/extras/924a591fb536e509104b94e971a5ebdb.webm?t=1787824372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/extras/924a591fb536e509104b94e971a5ebdb.mp4?t=1787824372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIAN is a living world that fights back. You aren't just shooting bugs in an unchanging arena; you're invading a living, breathing ecosystem. With the alien threat always adapting to your squad's tactics, your 3-player team is forced to constantly communicate, reposition, and change strategies to survive this chaotic slugfest. </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3-PLAYER BLUE-COLLAR CREW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/extras/0d01cf2587a67f0d9f94e094790c946e.poster.avif?t=1787824372\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/extras/0d01cf2587a67f0d9f94e094790c946e.webm?t=1787824372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/extras/0d01cf2587a67f0d9f94e094790c946e.mp4?t=1787824372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the righteous battle cries of heroes. Here, combat is stripped down to a professional routine. Form a tight-knit trio of gritty, down-to-earth Exterminauts dealing with corporate honey traps and blood-soaked pest control. <u><strong>Every work order costs company money</strong></u>, so cover your crewmates, tally up your expenses, and survive your shift together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WEAPONIZED POWER TOOLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/extras/35e1e1b049c88d24e7006991f84761c9.poster.avif?t=1787824372\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/extras/35e1e1b049c88d24e7006991f84761c9.webm?t=1787824372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/extras/35e1e1b049c88d24e7006991f84761c9.mp4?t=1787824372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Industrial-grade gunplay where your everyday tools are your firearms. Unleash a flood of firepower with heavy-duty utility and repair equipment repurposed for slaughter. Activate the multi-purpose OVERDRIVE system to turn typical blue-collar gear into devastating, alien-shredding weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A HOSTILE ALIEN ECOSYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/extras/924a591fb536e509104b94e971a5ebdb.poster.avif?t=1787824372\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/extras/924a591fb536e509104b94e971a5ebdb.webm?t=1787824372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/extras/924a591fb536e509104b94e971a5ebdb.mp4?t=1787824372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIAN is a living world that fights back. You aren't just shooting bugs in an unchanging arena; you're invading a living, breathing ecosystem. With the alien threat always adapting to your squad's tactics, your 3-player team is forced to constantly communicate, reposition, and change strategies to survive this chaotic slugfest. </p>", "short_description": "Exterminauts is a co-op third-person PvE shooter using weaponized power tools and mad-science gadgets to exterminate alien pests. Take on MegaCorp contracts amid energy supremacy clashes, while aliens' thirst for Polymorphic Plasma disrupts plans. Punch In. Clean Up. Get Paid.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Italian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/6a891eeac0b69f5b218cf462a4af494815d59427/header.jpg?t=1787824372", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/ba0d55efc773f1754f1a806559d34a289d366ee6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787824372", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039200/ba0d55efc773f1754f1a806559d34a289d366ee6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787824372", "website": "https://www.exterminauts.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class